{"step_index":10002,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-25T13:42:08Z","thinking":"Initial focus is on verifying the updated markdown reader module. A test script will generate a markdown file containing tables and bulleted lists. The script will then extract data using the markdown reader and validate the extracted information against expected outputs. This process ensures the reader correctly parses markdown structures and extracts relevant content.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"python -c \"\nimport sys\nfrom pathlib import Path\nsys.path.insert(0, str(Path.cwd()))\n\nfrom src.extract.markdown_reader import read_markdown_file\nfrom src.extract.excel_reader import read_excel, extract_item_names\nfrom src.extract.file_handler import _EXCEL_EXTENSIONS, _MARKDOWN_EXTENSIONS, _PDF_EXTENSIONS\nfrom src.config import load_config\nfrom desktop_app.server_manager import DEFAULT_SERVERS\n\n# 1. Test extensions\nprint('[1] Extensions Check:')\nprint('  Excel:', _EXCEL_EXTENSIONS)\nprint('  MD:', _MARKDOWN_EXTENSIONS)\nprint('  PDF:', _PDF_EXTENSIONS)\n\n# 2. Test Markdown Reader\nsample_md = Path('scratch_test.md')\nsample_md.write_text('''\n# قائمة النواقص\n| كود | اسم الصنف | السعر |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 101 | بانادول اكسترا 24 قرص | 50 |\n| 102 | اوجمنتين 1 جم 14 قرص | 120 |\n\n## أصناف أخرى\n* كونكور 5 مجم 30 قرص\n* اماريل 2 مجم 30 قرص\n''', encoding='utf-8')\n\nmd_items = read_markdown_file(sample_md)\nsample_md.unlink()\nprint(f'[2] Markdown Items extracted: {len(md_items)}')\nfor it in md_items:\n    print('   -', it['item_name_raw'])\n\n# 3. Test Config\ncfg = load_config()\nprint('[3] Config Check:')\nprint('  Vision URL:', cfg.vision_api_url)\nprint('  Vision Model:', cfg.vision_model)\n\n# 4. Test Server Manager\nprint('[4] Server Manager Default Server:')\nprint('  GAI Studio Dir:', DEFAULT_SERVERS['gaistudio']['default_dir'])\nprint('  GAI Studio Port:', DEFAULT_SERVERS['gaistudio']['port'])\n\"","Cwd":"d:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy-vision","IsDaemon":false,"WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolAction":"Testing vision modules","toolSummary":"Run unit checks on new vision modules"}}]}
